15 0 obj
<< /A 44 0 R /Alt (Panel A contains three bar charts illustrating the components of the Fibroblast\205T cell crosstalk score: spatial adjacency, fibroblast type 2 mediators, and T-cell Th2 signature, with a mathematical integration noted below. Panel B presents a box plot showing significantly higher crosstalk scores in AR samples versus controls, with statistical annotation. Panel C is a scatter plot with regression line showing a strong positive correlation between crosstalk score and serum total IgE. Panel D is a scatter plot with regression line indicating a strong positive correlation between crosstalk score and SPT wheal diameter.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 32 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
16 0 obj
<< /A 45 0 R /Alt (Panel A shows a UMAP plot of cell clusters labeled by color and cell type. Panel B displays a dot plot with genes on the y-axis, cell types on the x-axis, and dots colored and sized by average expression and percent expressed. Panel C contains two fluorescent tissue images labeled nAR and AR, highlighting cellular structures in varied colors. Panel D presents close-up fluorescent micrographs of tissue for nAR and AR. Panels E to H show bar graphs with dot overlays comparing fibroblast occupancy and adjacency of four immune cell types to fibroblasts between nAR and AR, including statistical markers.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 34 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
17 0 obj
<< /A 46 0 R /Alt (Composite figure illustrating analysis of fibroblast and immune cell gene expression in allergic rhinitis \(AR\) versus controls, including volcano plot, bar and violin plots, tSNE clustering, and spatial maps. Colored dots, gene names, and grouped cell type proportions highlight differences in type 2 immunity genes, CD4+ T cell proximity, and immune cell subsets between groups.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 36 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
18 0 obj
<< /A 47 0 R /Alt (Eight-panel scientific figure showing bar and box plots \(A\205E, G, H\) and immunofluorescence images \(F\) analyzing CD4+ T cell signatures adjacent to fibroblasts in acute rejection \(AR\) and non-acute rejection \(nAR\) tissues. Panels A\205C display higher expression of IL-4, IL-5, and IL-13 mRNA in AR compared to nAR fibroblast-adjacent CD4+ T cells. Panels D and E show increased Th2 and GATA3 signatures in AR-adjacent cells, not observed in other groups. Panel F presents immunofluorescence images highlighting fibroblasts \(red\), CD4 \(blue\), and IL-4 \(green\) in AR \(top\) and nAR \(bottom\) tissues at 20 micrometer scale. Panel G compares core Th2 signature scores between ICOSL- and ICOSL+ groups, indicating higher scores in ICOSL+. Panel H depicts a dot plot of log2 fold changes in gene expression for adjacent versus non-adjacent CD4+ T cells, with significant differences for multiple genes.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 38 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
19 0 obj
<< /A 48 0 R /Alt (Bar chart labeled A shows interaction scores for multiple gene pairs, with TSLP-IL7R, OX40L-OX40, and ICOSL-ICOS marked significant in blue; others are gray. Image B shows fibroblasts and CD4+ T cells colored by IL7R status and proximity, with merges outlined. Bar chart C shows IL7R+ CD4+ T cells are more likely to be near fibroblasts than IL7R- cells, with significant p-value. Bar graph D lists Gene Ontology terms enriched among CD4+ T cell genes targeted by fibroblast ligands, with significance values. Scatterplots E and F display positive correlations between fibroblast ligand score and expression of GATA3 and IL4 in T cells, with R and p-values indicated.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 39 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
20 0 obj
<< /A 49 0 R /Alt (Diagram compares non-allergic rhinitis \(non-AR\) and allergic rhinitis \(AR\) nasal mucosa, illustrating fewer interactions and minimal signaling in non-AR, while AR shows activated COL1A1+PDGRA+ fibroblasts, increased signaling molecules, GATA3+ polarization, and CD4+ Th2 cell activation, highlighting mucosal inflammation and tissue remodeling in AR pathogenesis.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 40 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
